Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:34.21,Kick,,0,0,0,,VILLAGE · EXPLAINED
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:34.21,Title,,0,0,0,,WHEAT SOWING\NFALLS 15%
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:34.21,Foot,,0,0,0,,Source: Rural Voice · ETV Bharat (PTI)\NFull video on the channel
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.15,0:00:02.40,Big,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1640)\fad(120,150)}50 VS 59 LAKH HA
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:06.06,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}Farmers in India have sown about fifteen percent less wheat than at this time last year.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.51,0:00:08.47,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}Winter crops are called rabi crops.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.47,0:00:13.74,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}By the thirteenth of November, they covered about one hundred and seventy eight lakh hectares.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.74,0:00:16.54,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}A year ago, it was about two hundred and one lakh.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.99,0:00:21.03,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}Wheat covered fifty lakh hectares, against fifty nine lakh last year.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.03,0:00:23.90,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}Gram, or chana, is down more than twenty percent.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.35,0:00:24.59,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.59,0:00:28.56,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}The monsoon was thirteen percent below normal, so the soil is dry.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.56,0:00:34.21,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}Reservoirs and canals are below normal in key wheat states, and wheat needs several waterings.
